      "They correctly point out that T = {1..8} U {9, 11, 13, 15, 17, 19, 21, 23} gives size 16 <= 16, and gives every voter in N exactly 9 approvals (> 8), so (8,8,8,8,8,8,8,8) is formally blocked by S = N.",
